# Response time distribution

The mean is 268 ms and the median is 205 ms, and neither number is the finding.
The finding is the second cluster past 400 ms: a distinct population of slow
requests that a summary statistic averages away and only a distribution shows.
Bars touch because the axis is continuous, and the two long tail rows are real
requests, not noise to be trimmed.

